{"lines": [{"text": "Four easy payments of $25, and zero interest.", "start": 0.6, "end": 4.392, "spec": null, "words": [["Four", 0.125, 0.33], ["easy", 0.341, 0.58], ["payments", 0.58, 0.977], ["of", 0.989, 1.068], ["$25", 1.068, 2.125], ["and", 2.352, 2.477], ["zero", 2.477, 2.898], ["interest", 2.909, 3.455]]}, {"text": "So who is paying for that loan?", "start": 4.642, "end": 6.202, "spec": null, "words": [["So", 0.102, 0.227], ["who", 0.239, 0.341], ["is", 0.341, 0.432], ["paying", 0.443, 0.739], ["for", 0.739, 0.83], ["that", 0.83, 0.989], ["loan", 0.989, 1.239]]}, {"text": "It splits your purchase into four chunks, paid over about six weeks.", "start": 6.452, "end": 10.604, "spec": null, "words": [["It", 0.091, 0.148], ["splits", 0.148, 0.466], ["your", 0.466, 0.557], ["purchase", 0.557, 1.0], ["into", 1.011, 1.227], ["four", 1.239, 1.591], ["chunks", 1.591, 2.114], ["paid", 2.455, 2.693], ["over", 2.693, 2.898], ["about", 2.898, 3.091], ["six", 3.091, 3.33], ["weeks", 3.341, 3.818]]}, {"text": "You pay no interest, so the lender needs another way to earn money.", "start": 10.854, "end": 14.55, "spec": null, "words": [["You", 0.08, 0.159], ["pay", 0.17, 0.341], ["no", 0.352, 0.545], ["interest", 0.545, 1.068], ["so", 1.307, 1.455], ["the", 1.455, 1.557], ["lender", 1.568, 1.977], ["needs", 2.08, 2.307], ["another", 2.318, 2.614], ["way", 2.614, 2.75], ["to", 2.761, 2.83], ["earn", 2.841, 3.034], ["money", 3.034, 3.352]]}, {"text": "Mostly, it is the store that pays.", "start": 14.8, "end": 17.248, "spec": null, "words": [["Mostly", 0.091, 0.614], ["it", 0.773, 0.852], ["is", 0.852, 0.943], ["the", 0.955, 1.023], ["store", 1.023, 1.443], ["that", 1.443, 1.602], ["pays", 1.602, 2.102]]}, {"text": "On every sale, the shop hands the lender a fee, typically between 2 and 8 percent.", "start": 17.498, "end": 23.282, "spec": null, "words": [["On", 0.068, 0.205], ["every", 0.216, 0.5], ["sale", 0.5, 0.977], ["the", 1.182, 1.261], ["shop", 1.261, 1.557], ["hands", 1.557, 1.875], ["the", 1.875, 1.955], ["lender", 1.955, 2.33], ["a", 2.33, 2.364], ["fee", 2.375, 2.875], ["typically", 3.318, 3.682], ["between", 3.693, 4.08], ["2", 4.091, 4.489], ["and", 4.591, 4.705], ["8 percent", 4.818, 5.443]]}, {"text": "A regular card payment often costs only around 2 to 3 percent.", "start": 23.532, "end": 27.852, "spec": null, "words": [["A", 0.068, 0.114], ["regular", 0.114, 0.443], ["card", 0.443, 0.705], ["payment", 0.716, 1.023], ["often", 1.159, 1.477], ["costs", 1.477, 2.011], ["only", 2.068, 2.318], ["around", 2.318, 2.659], ["2", 2.67, 3.08], ["to", 3.091, 3.193], ["3 percent", 3.25, 4.0]]}, {"text": "So why would a store pay more?", "start": 28.102, "end": 29.974, "spec": null, "words": [["So", 0.091, 0.25], ["why", 0.25, 0.432], ["would", 0.432, 0.511], ["a", 0.511, 0.545], ["store", 0.545, 0.784], ["pay", 0.795, 0.943], ["more", 0.955, 1.284]]}, {"text": "Because a $100 jacket suddenly feels like a $25 jacket.", "start": 30.224, "end": 34.448, "spec": null, "words": [["Because", 0.08, 0.364], ["a", 0.489, 0.534], ["$100 jacket", 0.534, 1.5], ["suddenly", 1.625, 2.023], ["feels", 2.034, 2.432], ["like", 2.432, 2.545], ["a", 2.545, 2.58], ["$25 jacket", 2.591, 3.886]]}, {"text": "Shoppers check out more, abandon fewer carts and fill bigger baskets.", "start": 34.698, "end": 39.306, "spec": null, "words": [["Shoppers", 0.091, 0.443], ["check", 0.443, 0.659], ["out", 0.67, 0.807], ["more", 0.807, 1.182], ["abandon", 1.545, 2.034], ["fewer", 2.034, 2.33], ["carts", 2.33, 2.761], ["and", 2.886, 3.091], ["fill", 3.091, 3.455], ["bigger", 3.455, 3.693], ["baskets", 3.705, 4.284]]}, {"text": "The store gives up a few dollars to win a bigger sale.", "start": 39.556, "end": 42.364, "spec": null, "words": [["The", 0.091, 0.136], ["store", 0.136, 0.432], ["gives", 0.432, 0.591], ["up", 0.602, 0.693], ["a", 0.693, 0.727], ["few", 0.739, 1.034], ["dollars", 1.034, 1.42], ["to", 1.432, 1.534], ["win", 1.534, 1.727], ["a", 1.739, 1.784], ["bigger", 1.784, 2.057], ["sale", 2.068, 2.466]]}, {"text": "Then come the late fees.", "start": 42.614, "end": 44.486, "spec": null, "words": [["Then", 0.091, 0.33], ["come", 0.545, 0.682], ["the", 0.682, 0.75], ["late", 0.75, 0.955], ["fees", 0.966, 1.455]]}, {"text": "Miss a payment, and many lenders charge a flat fee of several dollars.", "start": 44.736, "end": 49.248, "spec": null, "words": [["Miss", 0.08, 0.239], ["a", 0.239, 0.284], ["payment", 0.284, 0.693], ["and", 1.091, 1.193], ["many", 1.205, 1.443], ["lenders", 1.443, 1.83], ["charge", 1.898, 2.261], ["a", 2.318, 2.364], ["flat", 2.364, 2.773], ["fee", 2.773, 3.227], ["of", 3.239, 3.33], ["several", 3.341, 3.648], ["dollars", 3.648, 4.159]]}, {"text": "In one US government study, about one in eight borrowers paid a late fee.", "start": 49.498, "end": 53.794, "spec": null, "words": [["In", 0.068, 0.17], ["one", 0.17, 0.409], ["US", 0.409, 0.75], ["government", 0.75, 1.057], ["study", 1.057, 1.432], ["about", 1.636, 1.955], ["one", 1.966, 2.193], ["in", 2.193, 2.284], ["eight", 2.295, 2.477], ["borrowers", 2.489, 2.932], ["paid", 2.943, 3.25], ["a", 3.25, 3.284], ["late", 3.284, 3.568], ["fee", 3.568, 3.955]]}, {"text": "Still, store fees earned lenders roughly nine times more than late fees.", "start": 54.044, "end": 58.796, "spec": null, "words": [["Still", 0.091, 0.455], ["store", 0.693, 0.966], ["fees", 0.966, 1.33], ["earned", 1.33, 1.511], ["lenders", 1.511, 1.966], ["roughly", 2.091, 2.455], ["nine", 2.455, 2.886], ["times", 2.886, 3.261], ["more", 3.261, 3.58], ["than", 3.58, 3.716], ["late", 3.716, 3.909], ["fees", 3.92, 4.42]]}, {"text": "Some also earn interest on longer plans and money from ads in their apps.", "start": 59.046, "end": 62.982, "spec": null, "words": [["Some", 0.091, 0.205], ["also", 0.205, 0.489], ["earn", 0.489, 0.636], ["interest", 0.648, 1.08], ["on", 1.08, 1.193], ["longer", 1.205, 1.511], ["plans", 1.523, 1.943], ["and", 1.943, 2.125], ["money", 2.136, 2.409], ["from", 2.42, 2.591], ["ads", 2.693, 2.989], ["in", 2.989, 3.045], ["their", 3.045, 3.17], ["apps", 3.17, 3.614]]}, {"text": "So the free loan is mostly paid for by the shop, and sometimes by you.", "start": 63.232, "end": 67.792, "spec": null, "words": [["So", 0.091, 0.227], ["the", 0.227, 0.307], ["free", 0.307, 0.545], ["loan", 0.557, 0.92], ["is", 1.023, 1.136], ["mostly", 1.136, 1.602], ["paid", 1.602, 1.955], ["for", 1.955, 2.045], ["by", 2.057, 2.17], ["the", 2.182, 2.239], ["shop", 2.25, 2.636], ["and", 3.057, 3.182], ["sometimes", 3.318, 3.784], ["by", 3.784, 3.943], ["you", 3.955, 4.216]]}, {"text": "Have you ever bought something only because you could split it into four?", "start": 68.042, "end": 71.714, "spec": null, "words": [["Have", 0.091, 0.159], ["you", 0.17, 0.284], ["ever", 0.284, 0.545], ["bought", 0.545, 0.75], ["something", 0.761, 1.17], ["only", 1.182, 1.602], ["because", 1.693, 2.102], ["you", 2.102, 2.205], ["could", 2.216, 2.341], ["split", 2.352, 2.693], ["it", 2.693, 2.75], ["into", 2.75, 2.943], ["four", 2.943, 3.33]]}], "dur": 73.51}